        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana ZA2001, Modern Value Series Toilet Tissue Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis wall mounted toilet tissue dispenser is made of zinc and aluminum. Available in satin nickel or polished chrome finishes, the Modern Value ZA Series Toilet Paper Holder is made with the attention to quality for which Deltana is known. The contemporary square shape brings interesting design to the lowly toilet paper holder.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-ZA2001-specifications.gif?v=1704354509\" width=\"600\" height=\"324\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana ZA2001 Toilet Paper Holder Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana ZA Series\"><b>Deltana ZA Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the ZA Single Post \"L\" Shaped Toilet Paper Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: zinc and aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Arm Length: 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Length: 1-1/8\" squared</li>\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-ZA2001.pdf?v=1704262293\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana ZA2001 Toilet Paper Holder Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 toilet tissue holder, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
